---
title "Install NSIS"
---

= Install NSIS

Puts `makensis` on PATH via winget (`NSIS.NSIS`). Windows only. Reusable from Scriptbook or `ibex plugins install-tool nsis`.

::: playbook [id="install-nsis" shell="pwsh"]
::: step [id="winget" confirm=true]
```
if ($env:OS -notmatch 'Windows') {
  Write-Error 'NSIS is Windows-only.'
  exit 1
}
if (-not (Get-Command winget -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)) {
  Write-Error 'winget not found. Install NSIS from https://nsis.sourceforge.io/Download'
  exit 1
}
winget install --id NSIS.NSIS -e --accept-package-agreements --accept-source-agreements
```
:::
:::
